{"id":"86cbce3a1cf81eaf","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map.md","title":"ZFC Logic Symbol Arity Map","display":"df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map — ZFC Logic Symbol Arity Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map — ZFC Logic Symbol Arity Map","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map — ZFC Logic Symbol Arity Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-language.md\">../batch01/58-df-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> (candidate symbol-arity map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\\)</span> (bound symbol classes in a presentation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}_S\\)</span> (language predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-language.md\">../batch01/58-df-language.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymbolArityMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SymbolArityMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}arity\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{SymbolArityMap}_S(a,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\\;\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}arity\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{SymbolArityMap}_S(a,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\\;\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The language atom already types arities on all function, relation, and constant symbols and enforces arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> for constants.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}_S$ (language predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-language.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SymbolArityMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}arity\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{SymbolArityMap}_S(a,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\\;\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1166,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2478","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map.md|58-df-zfc-logic-symbol-arity-map]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d81b1b2123168018"]}